{"inkVersion":20,"root":[["ev","str","^Jesse","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Well, that ain’t the best drink of my life under these cacti but it sure quenched my thirst!","\n","ev","str","^Rana","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Glad to hear it at least got the job done.","\n","ev","str","^Jesse","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^So, what do you think about that there town outlaw, Winston?","\n","ev","str","^Rana","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^I think he’s as mean and nasty as they come from whatever pit he crawled up from.","\n","ev","str","^Jesse","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^You’re exactly right!","\n","ev","str","^Rana","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Yeah! Precisely!","\n","ev","str","^Jesse","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^That’s why I’m gonna cadaverify him!","\n","ev","str","^Rana","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Wait--","\n","ev","str","^Jesse","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^I’ll do it while he’s asleep.","\n","ev","str","^Rana","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Hey, maybe that’s a little too far.","\n","ev","str","^Jesse","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Thank you, wise gnome, for leading me to this conclusion.","\n","ev","str","^Rana","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Ew no, don’t say that.","\n","ev","str","^Jesse","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^I bid y'all adios.","\n",["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}}